# The pinned inference stack, identical to requirements-gpu.txt minus JAX itself.
#
# JAX is installed separately by the Dockerfile through the JAX_SPEC build arg, because
# the laptop wants CPU wheels and the clusters want the CUDA-12 ones, from the same
# definition. Everything else is the same on both.
#
# These are the versions the paper's benchmark was validated against. Changing one means
# re-running the benchmark before trusting a comparison against the published numbers.

